United Protest

[en.FOCUS_C14_METEOR_END_MILITARY_ROCK_desc]
The terrible thing about offending the Apple family is not our military power, but our friendship network: an offsense to the Apple family is an offense to all our friends!

[zh.FOCUS_C14_METEOR_END_MILITARY_ROCK]
联合抗议

[zh.FOCUS_C14_METEOR_END_MILITARY_ROCK_desc]
得罪苹果家族的可怕之处不在于我们的军事力量，而在于我们的友谊网络：对苹果家族的得罪就是对我们所有朋友的得罪！

